<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria offers four coupon T-bill issues April 14.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria offers four coupon T-bill issues April 14.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry will offer four issues of floater coupon T-bills with maturities of three, six, nine and 12 months at auctions on Monday, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The issues will be offered with no par value or minimum acceptable price set in advance.</p>
<p>The coupons are set equal to the central bank's main interest rate, now set at 17.14 percent monthly or 205.68 percent annually.</p>
<p>Details of the issues follow: </p>
<p> Issue number    BG3027197022	BG3027297020</p>
<p> Term		three months	six months</p>
<p> Auction date    April 14	    April 14</p>
<p> Issue date	April 16	    April 16</p>
<p> Maturity date   July 16	     October 15</p>
<p> Issue number    BG3027397028	BG3027497026</p>
<p> Term		nine months	 12 months</p>
<p> Auction date    April 14	    April 14</p>
<p> Issue date	April 16	    April 16</p>
<p> Maturity date   January 14, 1998  April 15, 1998 @</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
